        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Interview Transcript"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Hi Maria,**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I got a note from Jonathan Smith about the **Frontend Engineer role** at Servimatt and wanted to follow up directly."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I’d love to learn more about Servimatt’s work and see how my background might fit. Do you have any time later this week or early next for a quick chat?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Warm regards,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Sample User**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Chicago-based software engineer and product designer"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Hello Sample User, thanks for joining us here. I’m Maria from Servimatt and you were recommended by Wellfound. Thank you for accepting the invite, how’s your day going so far?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Hey Maria Ramirez, doing well, thank you! I hope your day’s been good too. I appreciate you reaching out and look forward to learning more about the opportunity."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> Sample User"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> Hey Maria Ramirez, doing well, thank you! I hope your day’s been good too. I appreciate you reaching out and look forward to learning more about the opportunity."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I'm doing great thanks for asking. Are you fully available for us to proceed?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Yes, I’m fully available to move forward"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> Sample User"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> Yes, I’m fully available to move forward and continue the process"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Great to hear! let me quickly share how our hiring process works so you know what to expect as we proceed:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Quick chat to confirm interest & role fit"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. Short assessment"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. Interview round with Technical recruiter"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. Background check & documentation"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. Critical review"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "6. Offer letter + onboarding"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We’ll take it one step at a time so it’s simple and clear okay?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Sounds great, I'm ready to proceed"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> Sample User"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> Sounds great, I'm ready to proceed"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Perfect. The next step is a quick introductory chat where you tell me about yourself and then I’ll walk you through the assessment which contains everything you need to know about the position okay?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Sounds good! Would this chat be over video or in this thread?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> Sample User"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> Sounds good! Would this chat be over video or in this thread?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This initial conversation will take place over text before moving forward to the main interview, which will be conducted via phone call."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Understood, ready to proceed when you are."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> Sample User"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> Understood, ready to proceed when you are."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Alright, can you share a quick intro about yourself and your background?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Sure thing,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I'm a full-stack software engineer and product designer with over six years of experience building intuitive, customer-facing applications. My focus area is NextJS, Node.js and modern front-end frameworks, UX, and accessibility. I approach everything with design thinking, from UI & branding to systems architecture."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "My coding journey began when I discovered Game Maker in 2010. I’d spend hours after school building Sonic the Hedgehog fan games, sharing them online, and learning how to improve my skills. Eventually I began learning how to build games in JavaScript, which was the gateway drug that led me to front-end and eventually full-stack development."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "These days I am working at a California-based creative agency build custom web apps for non-profits and small businesses, and running a small dev shop of my own called Turtle Labs."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I love what I do, I'm always learning, and I love solving hard problems."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> Sample User"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> Sure thing,   I'm a full-stack software engineer and product designer with over six years of experience building intuitive, customer-facing applications. My focus area is NextJS, Node.js and…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-61",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Interesting, what’s your ideal work schedule, since we offer flexibility but also want to align with your peak productivity hours?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-62",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I usually do my best work late morning through mid evening, roughly 11am - 7pm Pacific.  That said, I'm flexible when collaboration requires it. Overlap with the team and consistent output is my biggest priority."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> Sample User"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-64",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-65",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-66",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> I usually do my best work late morning through mid evening, roughly 11am - 7pm Pacific.  That said, I'm flexible when collaboration requires it. Overlap with the team and consistent output is…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-67",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-68",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Noted. And have you ever been part of a distributed or remote team before, because we’re spread across time zones but stay connected daily through Teams and Slack?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-69",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Yes, I have. During my time at [64 Robots](https://www.64robots.com/) I was part of a distributed team where most folks were based in Spain and Ghana. I was one of few devs located in the U.S. I actually enjoyed it. The time zone gap worked well since I tend to stay up late and do my clearest thinking later in the day. It helped me develop some strategies for myself to keep async communication tight across timezones."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-70",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "64 Robots | Baltimore's Kickass Software Agency"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-71",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Also, since you came in recommended, I’m curious if are you genuinely excited about this role, or just checking things out to see where it goes?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-72",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**I'm genuinely excited about the role.** I was very happy and grateful to have been referred, especially after doing a deep dive on the company. For a while I’ve wanted to do more work connected to industrial design and manufacturing, so this role feels like a natural bridge."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-73",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> Sample User"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-74",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-75",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-76",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> I'm genuinely excited about the role. I was very happy and grateful to have been referred, especially after doing a deep dive on the company. For a while I’ve wanted to do more work connected…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-77",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-78",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Well, we’re offering a competitive salary of $96,000 per year, along with a comprehensive benefits package that includes health coverage, paid time off, and professional development support. On top of that, we provide a monthly stipend to cover remote work expenses and fully equip your home office with the tools you need. Does this align with what you were hoping for in your next role?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-79",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "That aligns perfectly. The range and benefits sound great, and I really appreciate the emphasis on supporting remote work and professional growth. Those are both important to me. My main focus is to contribute meaningfully while continuing to stretch my skills both creatively & technically, so yes this feels very aligned with what I'm looking for in my next role."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-80",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Alright, the next step is a short 15-minute personality and cognitive aptitude test. Your assessment code is SMT13D. Once the assessment is submitted, our technical recruiter will review your performance and reach out within 24 hours to schedule an interview via Microsoft Teams"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-81",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "[https://talentneural.com/careers/servimatt/frontend-engineer/assessment/](https://talentneural.com/careers/servimatt/frontend-engineer/assessment/)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-82",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Servimatt Careers | Servimatt Assessment"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-83",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Welcome to the Frontend Engineer assessment for Servimatt. Submit your answers and get notified instantly."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-84",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Got it, thanks Maria. I’ll complete the assessment shortly and will let you know once it’s submitted. Appreciate you walking me through the process."
        }
      ]
    },
